ravě", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6c309b1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><span>Technologické firmy</span><span>Průmysl a B2B</span><span>Služby</span><span>Gastro a kluby</span><span>Reality</span><span>E-shopy</span></p>", "_css_classes": "ww-tags"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4bba046", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Jak spolupráce probíhá", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "dc17916", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ol class=\"ww-steps-list\"><li><b>Úvodní hovor</b> – telefonem, online nebo osobně.</li><li><b>Návrh a nabídka</b> – jasná cena a termín zdarma.</li><li><b>Realizace</b> – průběžně vidíte, jak web roste.</li><li><b>Spuštění a SEO</b> – aby vás našli lidé z Ostravy.</li></ol>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f0f66a1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Domluvit konzultaci", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "22c95f8", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "sluzby"}, "elements": [{"id": "694bd00", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "49bf5a8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "07c2abb", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "c98535c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title"